id: pm-beads-4kw8
title: Isolate malformed title aliases in existing Beads validation
description: "Synthetic reproduction: validateBeadsText on a row whose title is an object with a non-callable toString throws TypeError instead of returning a row-level validation issue. The new repair boundary validates title/name types and retains this as an isolated invalid_record gap; existing validate/import coercion behavior remains a separate follow-up. Align the existing producer and validator schema before changing compatibility."
